  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:0",
      "text": "Two things from the infra board. First, the staging certificate expires on the 12th."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:1",
      "text": "The wildcard one? That's still manual because of the old DNS provider."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:2",
      "text": "Yes. Last time it lapsed, every preview build failed for half a day."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:3",
      "text": "Right, I remember. The renewal itself is ten minutes, it's the DNS record that's annoying."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:4",
      "text": "So the cert needs renewing before the 12th, and we should move it to automatic renewal after this."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:5",
      "text": "Agreed. I'll ping you when the DNS access is sorted."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:6",
      "text": "Great. Second thing, the log retention change."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:7",
      "text": "Thirty days for application logs, ninety for audit logs. I merged that yesterday."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:8",
      "text": "Lovely. Then I'll update the data retention page to match."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:9",
      "text": "Thanks. That's all from me."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-staging-cert:seg:10",
      "text": "Same. Talk tomorrow."
    }
  ],
